<main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap hero-grid">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> One platform. Clearer control.</div>
                <h1>Understand your network.<br><span>Own every decision.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-copy">SAIFNEX brings network policy, device control, operational visibility, and trusted edge management into one unified Network Intelligence &amp; Control Platform.</p>
                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#platform">Discover SAIFNEX <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#architecture">How it works <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
                </div>
                <div class="trustline">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                    Designed around transparent policy, accountable control, and secure-by-default operations.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="preview-shell" aria-label="Illustrative SAIFNEX dashboard preview">
