                <div><div class="kicker">The SAIFNEX approach</div><h2>Backend complexity. Frontend clarity.</h2><p>No confusing maze of settings. No AI dependency for core protection. No silent trust shortcuts.</p></div>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#faq">Explore our principles <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
